WEBVTT

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.850
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.380
In this wide world

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.550
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:35.130
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:38.760
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:45.870
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.840
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:56.150
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:58.910
Awaken now

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:12.200
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:19.470
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:22.240
It's certain

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:26.610
Woh woh

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.220
Oh, Keiichi...

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:37.950
Oh, Keiichi...

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:41.750
What is it?

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.260
Good morning, Keiichi.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:48.630
What is this?!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.860
Is it to your liking?

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:55.000
Jeez, Keiichi! Do you have to be so noisy
this early in the morning?!

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.310
Belldandy never does this kind of
thing for you, does she?

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:02.780
No! She doesn't! And I don't
want her to either!

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.790
Stop being so stubborn,
and make me a wish...

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:07.620
and you could have this ALL the time.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:08.820
Oh, dear.

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.520
YOU'RE GROSS!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.300
Perhaps that was a little
overstimulating for a child.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:25.110
If you keep playing with toys like that,
you'll never be able to grant wishes.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.380
You'll always be useless.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.340
These aren't toys! And I'm not useless!

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:30.680
We'll have to continue this later,
as we've been so rudely interrupted.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:33.850
You're wrong for granting dirty
wishes in the first place!
We'll have to continue this later,
as we've been so rudely interrupted.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:34.680
We'll have to continue this later,
as we've been so rudely interrupted.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.720
Grr... I CAN do it!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.550
Even I can grant wishes!

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:44.920
I think I'll head to class.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.230
So you were up to something again, were you?

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.660
I thought I already told you it's no use.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.670
I am only fulfilling my obligation
as a First Class Goddess.

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:58.900
Not that I'd expect a Second Class Goddess
like yourself to understand...

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.810
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:07.940
As a First Class Goddess, I don't have the
time to lounge the day away like you.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.250
You trying to pick a fight?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.550
Fine with me! I'm up for it.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.450
Peorth!

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.420
Yes?

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.300
And so...

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.270
We're having a contest to see who's
the most useful goddess!

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.010
It'll just be a lighthearted, little game,
not a contract or anything.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:41.780
If we did it for real, I'd be suspended
for violating regulations again.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.620
Well, the thing is...

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:46.150
You'll be the judge, Keiichi.
You don't have a problem with that, right?

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:47.560
Now, listen...

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:52.060
As ridiculous as it is, I suppose I have
no choice but to take you on.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.030
I don't exactly see the point of this...

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.330
Go ahead and tell us your wish!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.700
You're not listening...

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.540
Stop this, everyone!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.730
You're giving Keiichi a hard time.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.740
If you're afraid that I'll
take him away from you,

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:11.010
then why don't you take part
in the contest, too?

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.010
What?

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.310
Oh, how silly of me!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:18.180
If you had the ability, you'd have already
granted Keiichi's wish by now!

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.950
I, I...

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:29.460
Um, I need to get going to the university,
so can we continue with this when I get back?

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.500
University?!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.370
My teleportation spell...

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.200
My transport gun...

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.800
My dimensional slide spell...

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.700
WILL TAKE YOU!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.040
Nothing beats a First Class
Goddess's technique.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.880
Rather charming if I do say so myself...

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.400
My devices are the best in the world!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.850
The battle will be decided
on the university campus!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.990
Naturally!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.450
I won't lose to you!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.660
Oh no! Keiichi's going to be...

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.560
It's no use following us.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:03.720
If you come along you'll only find
that you cannot grant his wish.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.500
That's not true! I...

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.600
You mean to help Keiichi,

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.570
but I have to wonder if you'd only be
causing him more trouble.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.780
I'm right on the mark, aren't I?

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:21.480
Ever since that time, what I've most hated
about you is your hypocrisy.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.840
Peorth!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:30.420
Just stay there and continue to be
all wrapped up in yourself.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:37.830
I will prove that I am the one who can
grant Keiichi's wish, not you.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.770
Senior! That's...

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.580
What is it?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.480
Tamiya and the others broke that
bronze statue, and...

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.480
Senior!

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.590
They repaired it with wood glue,

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.790
but it's not able to support
a person's weight, so...

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.490
Guess I'm too late.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:15.370
A cold bath sure does get to you
this time of year...

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.310
Are you gonna be all right?!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.930
I'll go get you something warm to drink!

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.700
So cold...

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.150
Sweater, come here!

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.520
Thermal Coating cartridge, locked 'n loaded!

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.040
Anti-extreme-cold program, "Summer Mode"!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.920
No! My sweater!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.620
Come back here!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.780
No!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.590
What the heck?!

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.490
I-I can't move!

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.160
So hot...

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.350
Well, I know MY spell was perfect...

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.180
Just goes to show how Second Class
Goddesses don't follow through.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:02.480
What was that?!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.950
Have you got a problem?!

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:08.420
What the heck is going on here...

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.290
Do I even need to wonder?

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.290
Now that I think about it,
Belldandy hasn't shown up.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.900
I hope she's not all in a dither over
some other silly thing...

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:24.440
How can I put your mind at ease?

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.870
Senior!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.640
This is nice and warm!

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:28.770
Oh, thank...

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.710
For shame! And when I
already have Belldandy!

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.190
I might have known that's the
kind of thing he'd like.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.730
How perverted. But it won't
stop me from winning!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:48.200
The object of men's desires is the mystery
of the female form, after all.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.330
Come then, let us give him an eyeful!

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.090
GO!

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.860
Wh-What the heck?!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.710
Senior!

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.140
Hasegawa!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.110
What the... No way!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.810
Help me! I've become the wind!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.360
To become the wind. Truly a man's fantasy...

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.330
That's not the issue here!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.000
What the heck is going to
happen to him now?!

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.120
Wind magic never was in my
realm of specialty!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.530
Then would you mind not using magic
outside your realm of specialty?

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:31.070
What has most likely happened is that our
spells have interfered with each other,

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:36.310
and instead of summoning the wind, they have
transformed Keiichi into the wind itself.

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:38.110
So what will happen now?

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:42.640
Keiichi will fully become one with the wind,
and never return to his original form...

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.050
In return, he can flip up as
many skirts as he likes.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.320
Urd!

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.290
I-I'm just kidding!

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.460
Peorth, can you cancel the spell?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:54.860
I'm already on that.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:59.890
But... I don't know if even I can solve
this complicated formula...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.500
I'm disappearing...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.300
Keiichi!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.210
Keiichi!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.440
It's no good! I won't be able to do it in time!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:17.980
Keiichi!

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:22.820
Belldandy!

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:23.220
Big Sister!
Belldandy!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:23.690
Big Sister!

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.300
It's all right. I'm here.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:38.040
So come to me... Keiichi!

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.320
I'm sorry I took so long.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.430
What did Big Sister do?

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:09.330
She picked Keiichi out of that huge whirlwind.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:14.170
Even if she is an expert with wind spells,
she still goes overboard.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:17.010
I can't believe it!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.140
I can't believe Belldandy would make such
an excessive show of power...

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:25.650
I figured you wouldn't get it, seeing as how you
only knew Belldandy when she was in Heaven.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.120
What do you mean by that?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.560
Well, I guess you'll just have to face the facts.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.350
What are you talking about?!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.530
Okay, I lose, I lose!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.260
C'mon, Skuld, we're going home.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.770
Ow, ow, ow!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.820
B-Big sister!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.630
B-Belldandy?

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:47.170
Keiichi! I'm sorry about what
my sisters did to you.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.010
I couldn't say anything to stop them...

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.050
You don't need to apologize for that.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.150
But...

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:57.280
Thanks for coming.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.380
It really makes me happy.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.190
Keiichi!

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:08.800
You're always doing so much for me,
but I've done nothing in return.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:13.070
Not at all! Just the fact that you want me
here makes me happy enough,

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:16.160
and it gives me the strength to do anything.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.270
Thank you.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:19.740
No, thank YOU!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.510
I don't get it at all.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:27.140
What the heck IS it with those two?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:32.820
But you know, it's because he's like that
that Belldandy puts so much faith in him.

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:37.460
Well that would make it simple.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:41.390
All I need to do is make Keiichi's heart
all mine and only mine.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.470
Yes, no matter what it takes...

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.750
I'm back.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.110
Welcome home!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.450
Oh... I'm sorry...

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.620
Welcome back.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.480
Huh? Um...

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.490
Welcome home.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.260
Yes!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:12.760
I'm back.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.660
W-What the heck was that?

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.530
What is with the insanely sticky-sweet
atmosphere in this place?!

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:24.540
Is Keiichi really satisfied with this kind of
elementary-school-level lovey-dovey crap?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.500
No! That simply cannot be!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:32.280
After all, I confirmed earlier that he does
indeed have the normal desires.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:38.620
As I thought, even if it means
being aggressive.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:45.820
"Giant X" enlargement potion,
"P1-0" underwater breathing potion.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.960
As usual, nothing but worthless potions...

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:51.290
Where is the one I need?

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.830
Here it is! "Seeds of Love"!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:58.970
But it is a vulgar drug, which will make its
user fall in love with anyone at random.

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:02.640
I shall improve on it and make it fabulous.

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.980
I shall call it "Drop of Love."

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:12.220
This is a most elegant drug,
which will make its user love only me!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:18.090
"Cleaning, sweeping, cleaning,
sweeping, so much fun indeed!"

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:18.960
"Cleaning, sweeping, cleaning..."

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.460
Oh, how blissful!
"Cleaning, sweeping, cleaning..."

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.090
Oh, how blissful!

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.460
Peorth?

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.460
So have you granted Keiichi's wish yet?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.370
Well, you see...

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.570
You make me ashamed to be to be
a fellow First Class Goddess.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:38.370
What in Heavens have you done
for him as a goddess?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.680
A First Class Goddess is so designated
by being able to grant ALL wishes.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:46.410
That is our obligation.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:49.050
You are neglecting your obligation!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.850
Obligation? You've got it wrong.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.690
I...

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.100
Spare me the excuses.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.330
You see, I am different from you.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:04.470
I want to grant the innermost
wishes of his heart.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:05.770
And that's all.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.380
Sweating even in the winter...

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:14.680
Here.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:17.180
Oh, thanks, I app...

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.880
You're quite welcome.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:27.090
You must suspect me of putting
something in it!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.090
That's what you were thinking, isn't it?

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.770
All right, all right, I'll drink it already!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.930
Really? I'm so happy...

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.770
Well, there definitely WASN'T anything in it.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.300
Until now...

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:52.720
When you open your eyes,
all you see will be ME...

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.850
Huh? It's Keiichi. What's the matter?

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.090
Keiichi is taking a little break.

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:02.600
C'mon, let's go over that way
so as not to disturb him!

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.790
Whoa, hold on... Peorth!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:32.520
I want to grant every one of Keiichi's wishes.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:35.630
Not because of my obligations
as a First Class Goddess,

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:37.760
but because that's what I want in my heart.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.330
But...

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:46.870
Hey there!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:50.410
I know I'm a little late, but I wanted to
come see the pictures!

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.440
And he's asleep.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.650
You'll catch cold if you go
falling asleep out here!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:00.390
Oh, it's you, Megumi...

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.820
Yeah... Huh?!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.260
I love you.

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:07.090
Huh?

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:10.150
I love you... I love you so much.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.730
Wh-What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:16.200
Ah, I get it! You're talking about
sibling love, right?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.370
No, not that.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:21.140
I have noticed your manly charm.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:24.910
We can no longer be just
"brother" and "sister"!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.240
Well let's keep being just
brother and sister!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:29.270
Kei-chan!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.350
What about my feelings?!

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.120
Nothing I can do about them!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:36.860
Open up, Kei-chan!

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.260
What the heck is with her?!
Open up, Kei-chan!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:38.930
What the heck is with her?!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.600
Keep it down! I can't even hear the TV!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.160
Ah, sorry.

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:45.930
You see, Megumi's...

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.200
Keiichi...

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:47.960
Huh?

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:50.630
I love you.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.170
What?

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.540
That haggard face and those clothes
that always look the same

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.870
are so dreamy in a rebel kind of way...

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.620
Look, calm down, all right?

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.240
Oh, Kei-chan! I love you!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.890
What the heck is going on here?!

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.660
Oh, Keiichi?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.460
The effect of the drug should be
kicking in right about now.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.330
Come, tell me your heart's greatest desire!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.870
Oh, Keiichi!

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.540
So it was you after all?

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.870
K-Keiichi!

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:27.570
Oh, I can't take it, Kei-chan!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.810
Your wish is my command!

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:30.510
Oh, Kei-chan!
Your wish is my command!

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:31.850
Oh, Kei-chan!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.310
Keiichi!
Help!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.150
Hmm...

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:38.090
There's still one missing, no matter
how many times I count them.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.050
S-Someone DO something!

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.180
Keiichi?

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:43.520
I might have known.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.230
What the heck are you doing?!

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:49.760
Urd, is that you? Help me!

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.230
K-Keiichi?

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.930
That was close...

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:59.670
Keiichi! Turn the other way, would you?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:00.970
Huh?

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.440
It looks like Peorth made you
swallow a Seed of Love.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:07.610
Seed of Love? You mean...

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.920
This one was a little different, though.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.920
It seems she somehow altered a Seed of Love
and turned it into a drug of sheer temptation

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.050
that makes anyone that looks
at you your captive.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:21.560
Why the hell would she make
something like that?

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.200
She probably blew it.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.030
My drugs aren't the kind of stuff
any yo-yo could just walk in and use.

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:27.330
I see.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.830
I'll make you an antidote,
so just wait right there.

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:31.440
I'm counting on you!

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:34.410
God forbid that Belldandy would
end up like this, too!

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:39.200
Don't look at me right now!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.680
I love you!

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.050
Crap.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:46.190
You have a lot of nerve to come
barging in on us now!

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.290
You're not taking my Kei-chan from me!

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:51.060
Hmph! All's fair in love and war, girls.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.730
You said it!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.060
And that is why I am not going to hold back.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.170
Who do you think you are?!
Well, let me tell you...

00:18:58.170 --> 00:18:59.700
You've got some nerve!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.830
Keiichi?

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.000
You must not look at me!

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:08.030
Because the Seed of Love that Peorth
made will only mess you up, too!

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:11.610
Keiichi!

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:16.080
Is it so painful for you to face me?

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.050
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.710
I still want to be here, even if it is!

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.620
I want to be by your side!

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:30.860
Right now, I cannot grant the wish
Peorth says you have in your heart.

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:35.490
The truth is I want to make
ALL of your wishes come true!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.570
Not out of any obligation as
a First Class Goddess,

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:42.200
but because I want to grant them
of my own free will!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:51.180
But... would you still accept me,
even like I am?

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:57.250
Even if being with me will lead to
something even more difficult...

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.160
Belldandy!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:05.060
I've never experienced any hardship
while I've been with you!

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:11.130
After all, as long as you're with me,
my wish is already granted.

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:13.700
Oh, crap! Our eyes met!

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.800
Huh? Nothing happened...

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.100
Keiichi!

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:25.240
This light...

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.980
It's so warm.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.070
Huh? What was I doing?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.000
I feel like I just had a bad dream
or something...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.130
Oh, brother... so even I got caught in it?

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.810
And where do you think YOU'RE going?

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:54.610
Um, well... I just remembered
some urgent business I had.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:58.250
I see. Well, before you go, would you
mind telling me one thing?

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.020
I didn't do it!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.360
I didn't go into your room,
or take any of your drugs,

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.690
or try to monopolize Keiichi's heart!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.990
Ah, okay. Thank you.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:14.660
I'd expect no less of a First Class Goddess.
You just don't tell any lies, do you?

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.530
Well, anyway...

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:22.240
I didn't know WHAT was going to
happen for a minute there.

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.980
That's my line.

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:28.040
And now Belldandy's out like a light
again because of all that.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:34.110
But why didn't the drug work on her anyway?

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.590
That should be pretty obvious.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:38.960
My drugs aren't so unromantic
as to have any effect

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.980
on a couple who REALLY ARE
in love with each other.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:45.620
Hey, you know, I haven't seen Peorth around.

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:49.260
Ah, actually Peorth is...

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.970
Honestly, you are SO quiet.

00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:57.710
Don't make me do all the talking!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:02.380
I mean, we're already on very
good terms with each other.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:05.640
I'll do even more for you.

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:08.520
C'mon, please tell me what you want.

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:12.460
Oh, how I love that little,
round nose of yours!

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:16.050
You have such a charming little belly.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:20.770
Oh, now I want to tanook you, you lovely
little pot-bellied tanuki, you.

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.290
Tanook-tee-doo!

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:33.940
Woh, it starts to shine

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:50.730
The gentle wind I felt on my cheek

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:59.490
Was the start of the miracles you brought

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:07.640
As though my everyday life until
then had never existed

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:13.250
My new happy life, completely repainted

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.650
In the colors of spring

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:21.590
Even waking up early, even traffic jams

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:26.000
Even heavy things to carry,
even sleepless nights

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:30.340
Somehow I feel thankful for everything

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:35.040
Let's create more and more of our miracles

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:42.880
Woh, whatever kind of morning

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:51.390
Woh, it starts to shine

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:54.890
Every day is a miracle

00:23:55.730 --> 00:23:58.930
It should have been a fun first date.

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:03.340
In order to overcome the burden of a past
mistake, the goddess takes up an old challenge.

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:04.800
Next time, "Ah! The Goddesses
Go Head to Head on a Date!"

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:06.440
Ah! The Goddesses
Go Head to Head on a Date!
Next time, "Ah! The Goddesses
Go Head to Head on a Date!"

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:09.440
Ah! The Goddesses
Go Head to Head on a Date!
Bringing down meteors is going
a little overboard here!

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:09.740
Ah! The Goddesses
Go Head to Head on a Date!
